        <mxCell id="flow-step-details-text-61" value="&#10;&lt;b style=&quot;font-size:16px;&quot;&gt;Step S61: External Source to AWS Transfer Family (SFTP)&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br/&gt;&#10;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:13px;&quot;&gt;Move file to the next system&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br/&gt;&lt;br/&gt;&#10;&#10;&lt;b style=&quot;font-size:13px;&quot;&gt;Quick meaning&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br/&gt;&#10;- This keeps the ingestion flow moving safely.&lt;br/&gt;&#10;- Direction: One-way data flow&lt;br/&gt;&#10;- Transport: SFTP push on port N/A&lt;br/&gt;&#10;- Path: UKHSA-Data Ingestion&lt;br/&gt;&#10;- Security check: IAM / KMS (UKHSA mandatory)&lt;br/&gt;&lt;br/&gt;&#10;&#10;&lt;b style=&quot;font-size:13px;&quot;&gt;In one line&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br/&gt;&#10;Data moves from &lt;b&gt;External Source&lt;/b&gt; to &lt;b&gt;AWS Transfer Family (SFTP)&lt;/b&gt; in step &lt;b&gt;S61&lt;/b&gt;.&#10;" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=top;fontSize=9;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;" parent="1" vertex="1">
